<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea March overseas building orders up 55 pct. [CORRECTED 4:01 GMT]</title>
<headline>S.Korea March overseas building orders up 55 pct. [CORRECTED 4:01 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overseas construction orders received by South Korean companies shot up by 55 percent year-on-year to $1.24 billion in March, the Construction and Transportation Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Corrects percentage figure in headline and text from 155)</p>
</text>
